      "claim": "Perindoprilat, an ACE inhibitor active metabolite with two carboxylic acids, reached 30 ± 6% systemic availability after oral perindopril in cirrhotic patients, indicating that the ACE inhibitor active-acid class can exceed the 20% threshold.",
      "card_ids": ["C08"]
    },
